                "pt": "~MIRAI DAYS~"
            },
            "Summaries": {
                "eng": "Mirai and her friends, who miraculously reunited after several years, begin to walk toward their respective futures in their respective worlds. Mirai is now a university student in the No Magic Realm. Riko returns to the Magic World and becomes a teacher at a magic school. Mofurun remains next to Mirai. And Ha-chan watches over the world from afar. But then, a new disaster appears in the Magic World and the No Magic Realm world......? Mirai and Riko meet again for the first time in months, triggered by signs of a new calamity. While fighting off a mysterious enemy, the two are confronted with their past and their future...",
